<body language="English">
	<row id="msg_0543_T20R0101_00000" index="0">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">-</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0543_T20R0101_00001" index="1">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">-</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0543_T20R0101_00002" index="2">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Professor Elm: Ah, you must be the one\nGold told me about!\rCome in, come in.\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0543_T20R0101_00003" index="3">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">-</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0543_T20R0101_00004" index="4">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Professor Elm: You know, you remind me\nof someone.\rTwo someones, really.\rGold and Silver. They set off from\nthis region years ago. Rivals, the\fboth of them, and inseparable for it.\rGold became the finest trainer of his\nage. And Silver...\rWell. Silver became our Champion.\rAfter everything, he turned his life\naround. The whole world believes in\fhim now, and so do I.\rProud doesn’t begin to cover it.\rAnd now here you stand, at the very\nstart of your own journey.\rNow then - let’s see about getting\nyou a Pokédex of your own.\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0543_T20R0101_00005" index="5">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Professor Elm: How is the Pokédex\ntreating you?\rEvery entry you log helps the\ninstitute’s fieldwork.\fSafe travels out there!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0543_T20R0101_00006" index="6">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">-</language>
	</row>
